      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why doesn\u0027t this use AlarmManager which does the same thing?\n\nEven better, AlarmManager allows you to set inexact alarms by providing a wake window. (Though I seem to recall that those *may* not always trigger a wake up when they expire, you\u0027ll have to look into that.)",
      "revId": "4a7270cceebe257bf0af0a8c70c56f4181b89305",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "2739dec0_006451c4",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
