      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-12-11T21:29:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In order to make this generally useful, we should add functionality that lets you specify a wake window. This would actually be useful in a few places. I just checked, and it looks like both system_server and networkstack have CAP_WAKE_ALARM.",
